<div class="faq_wrap">
<div class="accordion"  id="accordionExample">
<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>What is Rudra Heights?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">Rudra Heights is a premium Residential 3 BHK project in Zundal, Ahmedabad, designed to offer a luxury experience with modern amenities and a prime location.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>How to get Rudra Heights brochure?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">You can easily download the brochure for Rudra Heights from our website, or request a physical copy by contacting our sales team.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>How is Zundal, Ahmedabad for buying a home?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">Zundal in Ahmedabad offers excellent opportunities for buying a home due to its growing infrastructure, serene environment, and proximity to essential amenities.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>How is Zundal for investment?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">Zundal is an emerging investment hotspot with promising returns due to rapid urban development and increasing demand for properties in the region.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>Why Rudra Heights is different than other 3 BHK projects in Zundal?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">Rudra Heights stands out in Zundal because of its unique design, high-quality construction, and premium amenities, making it the ideal choice for discerning buyers.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>Is Rudra Heights the best project for luxury living in Zundal?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">Yes, Rudra Heights offers the finest in luxury living in Zundal with state-of-the-art features, high-end finishes, and top-tier amenities.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>Why Rudra Heights is a top Residential project in Zundal?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">Rudra Heights is considered a top Residential project in Zundal due to its exceptional design, strategic location, and unbeatable value for money.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>Which are the top Amenities in Rudra Heights?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">Rudra Heights features premium amenities including 24x7 Security, Power Backup, Children's Play Area, 24x7 CCTV Surveillance, Vastu Compliant, Senior Citizen Siteout, Indoor Games, Electrical Meter Room, Piped Gas Connection, Water Conservation, Jogging Track, Visitor Parking, Toddler Play Area, Footpaths/ Pedestrian.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>What is the starting price for Rudra Heights, Zundal?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">The starting price for units in Rudra Heights is 67.2 L, with variations based on size, type, and payment terms.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>What is the sqft/area size for Rudra Heights, Zundal?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">The area size of units in Rudra Heights ranges from 1890 sqft, providing options for various needs and preferences.</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="accordion-item">
<div class="accordion-header" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)"><span>What is the possession date for Rudra Heights, Zundal?</span>

<div class="accordion-i"><i class="icon-down-arrow"></i></div>

<div class="accordion-content cms" style="display: none;">The possession date for Rudra Heights in Zundal is scheduled for Dec/2028, ensuring timely delivery of your dream home.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
